---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /guides/index.html
title: Practical Home Technology Guides | Naked Tech
description: Clear, practical guides for computers, Wi-Fi, printers, backups, passwords and your home office. Understand the problem and choose your next step.
robots: index, follow
---
<header class="bg-inverse pb-14 pt-32 text-inverse-ink md:pt-40">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <p class="mb-4 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent">The Naked Tech field guides</p>
    <h1 class="max-w-3xl text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight md:text-6xl">A little understanding.<br>A clearer next step.</h1>
    <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-inverse-ink/75">Practical help for the technology in your home. Start with a topic, understand what you’re seeing, and try the checks that fit—even if you never need a visit.</p>
  </div>
</header>
<div class="bg-canvas py-12 md:py-16" data-guide-library>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <div class="mb-10 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-5 md:p-7">
      <div data-guide-filter hidden>
        <label for="guide-query" class="mb-3 block text-lg font-bold">What would you like help with?</label>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <input id="guide-query" type="search" placeholder="Try printer, passwords or Wi-Fi" autocomplete="off" class="min-h-12 min-w-0 flex-1 rounded-xl border border-line bg-canvas px-4 text-ink focus:outline focus:outline-2 focus:outline-accent" aria-describedby="guide-result-count">
          <button type="button" data-guide-clear class="min-h-12 rounded-xl border border-line px-5 font-semibold hover:border-accent">Clear</button>
        </div>
        <p id="guide-result-count" class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
      </div>
      <details class="mt-5">
        <summary class="min-h-11 cursor-pointer py-3 font-semibold text-accent-ink">Browse by topic <span class="font-normal text-muted">· {{ guideLibrary.length }} topics</span></summary>
      <nav aria-label="Guide topics" class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        {% for topic in guideLibrary %}<a href="#{{ topic.id }}" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-full border border-line px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold transition-colors hover:border-accent hover:text-accent-ink">{{ topic.title }}</a>{% endfor %}
      </nav>
      </details>
    </div>
    <p data-guide-empty hidden class="mb-10 rounded-xl border border-line p-6 text-lg">No matching guides. Try a broader word, or clear the search to browse every topic.</p>
    <div class="grid items-start gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2">
      {% for topic in guideLibrary %}
      <section id="{{ topic.id }}" data-guide-topic class="scroll-mt-28 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-6 md:p-8" aria-labelledby="{{ topic.id }}-heading">
        <p class="mb-3 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent-ink">{{ topic.articles.length }} practical guides</p>
        <h2 id="{{ topic.id }}-heading" class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">{{ topic.title }}</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted">{{ topic.description }}</p>
        <ul class="mt-6 divide-y divide-line">
          {% for article in topic.articles %}
          <li data-guide-entry data-guide-terms="{{ topic.title }} {{ article.title }} {{ article.description }} {{ article.searchTerms }}" class="py-4 first:pt-0">
            {% if loop.first %}<p class="mb-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-accent-ink">Start here</p>{% endif %}
            <a href="{{ article.path }}" class="group flex min-h-11 items-center justify-between gap-4 font-bold leading-snug hover:text-accent-ink"><span>{{ article.title }}</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 text-accent-ink transition-transform motion-safe:group-hover:translate-x-1">→</span></a>
            {% if loop.first %}<p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">{{ article.description }}</p>{% endif %}
          </li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </section>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<script src="/assets/js/guide-library.js" defer></script>
